{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21025","headline":"神弦 · 李贺","name":"神弦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"女巫浇酒云满空，玉炉炭火香冬冬。\n海神山鬼来座中，纸钱窸窣鸣𩘶风\n相思木帖金舞鸾，攒蛾一啑重一弹。\n呼星召鬼歆杯盘，山魅食时人森寒。\n终南日色低平湾，神兮长在有无间。\n神嗔神喜师更颜，送神万骑还青山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}